letter.revisionRequest.body:
Hello {recipient_name},

{funder_name} has asked for a revision to **{application_title}**.

{revision_message}

Please respond by {revision_dueDate}: [Open the application]({links_application})

Thank you,
{funder_name}

letter.decline.body:
Hello {recipient_name},

Thank you for applying to {opportunity_title}. After review, {funder_name} is not able to fund **{application_title}** in this cycle.

{decision_message}

Your application and its record stay available to you: [View application]({links_status})

Sincerely,
{funder_name}

letter.paymentSent.body:
Hello {recipient_name},

{funder_name} sent **{payment_amount}** for {award_title} (payment {payment_sequence}).

- Destination: {payment_bankName} ending in {payment_last4}
- Sent: {payment_sentAt}

The destination is the one your organization verified in OpenGrants Passport. If you do not recognize it, contact {funder_name} at once.

[View payments]({links_award})
